        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - sentences:
    - This is a giant Golem in depth of the dugeon. The real challenge!
    - And graves of many adventurers come here before for to search for riches.
    options:
    - message: I will be careful.
      choosenEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 809709543}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: CutSceneController, Assembly-CSharp
